<title>UK: Deutsche unit sets $500 mln 5-year bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche unit sets $500 mln 5-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE BANK FINANCE NV CURACAO NETHERLANDS</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  DEUTSCHE BANK AG (AA1/AAA)</p>
<p> AMT    $500 MLN	COUPON     6.375     MATURITY    05.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.19    PAY DATE   L04.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.79     SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS US/UK/NETH ANT</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
